{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17567","headline":"和段相公登武担寺西台 · 李敬伯","name":"和段相公登武担寺西台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台上起凉风，乘闲览岁功。\n自随台席贵，尽许羽觞同。\n楼殿斜晖照，江山极望通。\n赋诗思共乐，俱得咏时丰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李敬伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}